      "details": "Create a new helper class org.jsoup.parser.ParserUtils with a single public static generic method <T> T withLock(java.util.concurrent.locks.ReentrantLock lock, java.util.concurrent.Callable<T> callable) that acquires the lock, calls callable.call(), unlocks in finally, and rethrows exceptions as RuntimeException. Place the class in the same package org.jsoup.parser.",
      "risk": "low"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE_CALL_SITES",
      "inputs": [
        "src/main/java/org/jsoup/parser/Parser.java"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "src/main/java/org/jsoup/parser/Parser.java"
      ],
      "details": "Replace the explicit try { lock.lock(); return treeBuilder.parse(inputHtml, baseUri, this); } finally { lock.unlock(); } in the public Document parseInput(Reader inputHtml, String baseUri) method with: return ParserUtils.withLock(lock, () -> treeBuilder.parse(inputHtml, baseUri, this)); Keep method signature and visibility unchanged. No change to public API.",
      "risk": "low"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE_CALL_SITES",
      "inputs": [
